1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Tired of green, algae-filled rainwater?

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,680
Without a cover, algae turns it green.

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,440
Two ten D Oxford fabric blocks the light.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,120
No light, no algae.

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,080
Buckle lock.

6
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,920
On and off in two minutes.

7
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,440
Opening up to the top lid.

8
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:15,720
Fits a thousand liter IBC tank.

9
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,840
Put the cover on.

10
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,400
The water stays clear.
